我理解您想要一个简单的思维导图，不过 markmap（markdown 思维导图）的展示需要特定渲染库。作为“单文件 HTML UI 生成器”，我将采用 **完全独立、无外部依赖、交互真实可用**的方式，为您输出一个 **手风琴式折叠大纲 + 搜索高亮** 来模拟思维导图的交互效果，这适用于快速预览结构、展开/折叠节点和定位内容。

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>交互式可折叠大纲 (Markmap 替代)</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #f8fafc;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --text: #1e293b;
            --border: #e2e8f0;
            --primary: #3b82f6;
            --primary-hover: #2563eb;
            --search-highlight: #fef3c7;
        }
        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            :root {
                --bg: #0f172a;
                --surface: #1e293b;
                --text: #f1f5f9;
                --border: #334155;
                --primary: #60a5fa;
                --primary-hover: #93c5fd;
                --search-highlight: #78350f;
            }
        }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 16px;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .title {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 24px 0 16px;
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        .subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            color: var(--text);
            opacity: 0.7;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        .search-box {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: var(--surface);
            color: var(--text);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .search-box:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
        }
        .accordion {
            background: var(--surface);
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .accordion-item {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .accordion-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .accordion-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
            transition: background 0.2s;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .accordion-header:hover {
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
        }
        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            .accordion-header:hover {
                background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            }
        }
        .accordion-header::after {
            content: '▾';
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        .accordion-header.active::after {
            transform: rotate(180deg);
        }
        .lvl-1 { padding-left: 16px; }
        .lvl-2 { padding-left: 32px; font-size: 0.95rem;}
        .lvl-3 { padding-left: 48px; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.9; }
        .accordion-content {
            padding: 0 16px;
            max-height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: max-height 0.3s ease-out, padding 0.3s;
            background: var(--bg);
        }
        .accordion-content.active {
            padding: 12px 16px;
            max-height: 1000px;
        }
        .content-inner {
            border-left: 2px solid var(--primary);
            padding-left: 12px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .highlight {
            background-color: var(--search-highlight);
            border-radius: 2px;
            padding: 0 2px;
        }
        .stats {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-top: 8px;
            opacity: 0.7;
            text-align: right;
        }
        .mobile-only {
            display: none;
        }
        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .mobile-only {
                display: block;
                font-size: 0.85rem;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
                opacity: 0.8;
